{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LibreOffice/core/compare/master...e9ca537a766e7aa093f9f71d2dea0c254aea6bba","html_url":"https://github.com/LibreOffice/core/compare/master...e9ca537a766e7aa093f9f71d2dea0c254aea6bba","permalink_url":"https://github.com/LibreOffice/core/compare/LibreOffice:8022c96...LibreOffice:e9ca537","diff_url":"https://github.com/LibreOffice/core/compare/master...e9ca537a766e7aa093f9f71d2dea0c254aea6bba.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/LibreOffice/core/compare/master...e9ca537a766e7aa093f9f71d2dea0c254aea6bba.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"8022c96652e845b32d15c0000fb8ccde4b81e9d7","node_id":"C_kwDOANXyoNoAKDgwMjJjOTY2NTJlODQ1YjMyZDE1YzAwMDBmYjhjY2RlNGI4MWU5ZDc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Giovanni Bertelli","email":"gio.bertelli@yahoo.it","date":"2026-11-12T15:46:17Z"},"committer":{"name":"Adolfo Jayme Barrientos","email":"fitojb@ubuntu.com","date":"2026-11-12T22:26:13Z"},"message":"tdf#174329: don't use private system fonts for glyph fallback\n\nCoreText can suggest a font for the missing characters that we cannot use:\na private system font (family name starting with a period, e.g.\n\".PingFang UI SC\" for the macOS system UI font) or an 'hvgl'-only font\n(tdf#163000). Those fonts are not in our font list and CoreText refuses to\ncreate them by name, so FindFontSubstitute() returned a family name that\ncould never be resolved. The generic glyph fallback list does not help\neither: all CoreText fonts have quality 0, so ImplInitGenericGlyphFallback()\nnever adds any font on macOS. The characters were therefore drawn with the\n.notdef glyph of the base font.\n\nSince .AppleSystemUIFont is the UI font now (tdf#173342), this made all\nnon-Latin UI text unreadable: Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Arabic, Hebrew,\nThai, Devanagari, etc. (tdf#174329).\n\nIf the suggested font is not usable, ask CoreText for the public fonts that\nsupport the same language and use the first one that has the characters.\n\nChange-Id: I9bacf6586ca24bb19aab55e0eab50589a445fdd4\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.libreoffice.org/c/core/+/214128\nReviewed-by: Adolfo Jayme Barrientos <fitojb@ubuntu.com>\nTested-by: Jenkins","tree":{"sha":"d4e19700b24c6a3abd9c7a7e9f3e397d6e044d40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LibreOffice/core/git/trees/d4e19700b24c6a3abd9c7a7e9f3e397d6e044d40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LibreOffice/core/git/commits/8022c96652e845b32d15c0000fb8ccde4b81e9d7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LibreOffice/core/commits/8022c96652e845b32d15c0000fb8ccde4b81e9d7","html_url":"https://github.com/LibreOffice/core/commit/8022c96652e845b32d15c0000fb8ccde4b81e9d7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LibreOffice/core/commits/8022c96652e845b32d15c0000fb8ccde4b81e9d7/comments","author":null,"committer":{"login":"fitojb","id":554953,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDk1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/554953?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fitojb","html_url":"https://github.com/fitojb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fitojb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fitojb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fitojb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fitojb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fitojb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fitojb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fitojb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fitojb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fitojb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"81cb5b1918ba28e26fc8120f8e076d832b7cec28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LibreOffice/core/commits/81cb5b1918ba28e26fc8120f8e076d832b7cec28","html_url":"https://github.com/LibreOffice/